            alt="Flow's Review Changes block: the title with a Proposed and Exact changes toggle and a '1 Check to resolve' pill, the effect sentence naming the file, a permission row reading 'Edit this document only' with 'No external action' and 'No Sources', and three named checks as pills reading Citations resolve Passed, References are current Not required, and Human review Not checked."
            caption="What is proposed, and every check that ran"
